        <rdfs:label xml:lang="la">quaestionis positio</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Atto di mettere a tema la questione e tenerla aperta.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The act of making the question a theme and keeping it open.</rdfs:comment>
